                        "form_id": "e1e7886e-2844-4d26-ae65-a3c6773d92fc",
                        "entry_id": "4b7e24c4-6f3a-3cdd-b681-1dad1de5d45d",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "impensées"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "64b3130c-7743-3c9b-ac70-33c18dabc5e8",
                        "entry_id": "4b7e24c4-6f3a-3cdd-b681-1dad1de5d45d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui n'a pas été précisé, pensé."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "eaf01da6-f9ac-4cb4-95f3-a985e15e51aa",
                                "sense_id": "64b3130c-7743-3c9b-ac70-33c18dabc5e8",
                                "text": "Nous sommes dans un monde impensé, impensable auparavant."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3cd6c3f4-6723-4126-aa27-f926e4dbec15",
                        "source_entry_id": "4b7e24c4-6f3a-3cdd-b681-1dad1de5d45d",
                        "source_sense_id": "64b3130c-7743-3c9b-ac70-33c18dabc5e8",
                        "target_lang_word": "unthought",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unthought",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4882b8c0-218e-30c2-bf93-d86f8256604e",
                                        "entry_id": "728638fc-bfd9-3318-8c63-b343f1135f48",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That which has not been (yet) thought; that which has yet to enter into the mind; a non-existent thought."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fbc3c58e-1509-487d-b6db-5ae1cccfe919",
                                                "sense_id": "4882b8c0-218e-30c2-bf93-d86f8256604e",
                                                "text": "But without his knowing, they interfere with his research and at the very least call on him to put the results in perspective. This is what we call the “unthoughts” of scientific work."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce5e7efe-ada6-4c4e-8243-195c1b6d65b3",
                                                "sense_id": "4882b8c0-218e-30c2-bf93-d86f8256604e",
                                                "text": "There is no tapping into some stream of desire yet to be revealed. Desire through cinemasochism resonates again with traditional masochism in the vertigo of being faced with an unthought that cannot be thought and a desire that cannot know itself […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc3d8b9c-03cb-47f2-a90d-f316bf11b061",
                                                "sense_id": "4882b8c0-218e-30c2-bf93-d86f8256604e",
                                                "text": "Modern thought renounces the pure transparency of the Cartesian cogito in the recognition that the cogito is intrinsically tied to an unthought which escapes the reflection of the cogito even as it makes this reflection possible."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "953b95e3-f960-4d07-a550-928ccafb01e2",
                                                "sense_id": "4882b8c0-218e-30c2-bf93-d86f8256604e",
                                                "text": "Given the power of the word, our lack of control over the word once it is spoken, and our even greater lack once it is published, I have often wondered: What may have been the consequences of my many published unthoughts?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "unthought",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6147d066-9319-3d32-b4d3-a3761b74ae98",
                                        "entry_id": "9d7b6402-a574-3524-9a09-2f1b53a0f40e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "simple past and past participle of unthink"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of",
                                            "participle",
                                            "past"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "unthought",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f3cbc8de-f6d0-38c1-abf9-b693b7708c38",
                                        "entry_id": "31932c09-1f68-3ba6-a121-5afa1760b54b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not having been thought."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b127289-3fcc-47eb-9c1d-d43711a5f89a",
                                                "sense_id": "f3cbc8de-f6d0-38c1-abf9-b693b7708c38",
                                                "text": "For Bion it is not thinking which produces thoughts but unthought thoughts which require an apparatus for thinking them."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "a4d010a0-3f63-37ff-be4b-f2d595752e04",
                "word": "impensé",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "686325fc-fc0e-47d0-875a-88aba9ad2d93",
                        "entry_id": "a4d010a0-3f63-37ff-be4b-f2d595752e04",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "impensés"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f6de6a45-113c-3eb9-86ea-573f8fde2779",
                        "entry_id": "a4d010a0-3f63-37ff-be4b-f2d595752e04",
                        "glosses": [
                            "État de ce qui est non formulé, non pensé."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "19510d7f-6460-4fd6-9b58-804cdba760cf",
                                "sense_id": "f6de6a45-113c-3eb9-86ea-573f8fde2779",
                                "text": "Informulées, ces énergies glissent dans l'impensé."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d3f86f81-5e19-416c-a231-e2ba048b4821",
                                "sense_id": "f6de6a45-113c-3eb9-86ea-573f8fde2779",
                                "text": "Les sans-abri sont les impensés et les exclus de la numérisation extrême de notre société."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6cf0ea45-b261-4bb8-bcf7-b16434d4ed5b",
                                "sense_id": "f6de6a45-113c-3eb9-86ea-573f8fde2779",
                                "text": "'Il y a encore fort à faire, à écouter Jean-Baptiste Bosson qui parle de la protection des glaciers et des zones postglaciaires comme d’un « impensé » dans le droit aujourd’hui. — (journal 20 minutes, édition Paris-IDF, 8 novembre 2023, page 8)"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5b67d4bf-eda7-3322-9e52-fd627fe7ccf4",
                        "entry_id": "a4d010a0-3f63-37ff-be4b-f2d595752e04",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Chose niée."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3c4c9ad7-4975-44d6-a01d-50b016eab36b",
                                "sense_id": "5b67d4bf-eda7-3322-9e52-fd627fe7ccf4",
                                "text": "La responsabilité d'un pavillon d'arriérés profonds adultes m'a fait découvrir l'impensé de la violence des limites de l'humain. Cet impensé radical se loge au plus profond des soignants, des psychiatres,"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9a7a1be1-48d1-494b-ba94-a7dc12585ba7",
                                "sense_id": "5b67d4bf-eda7-3322-9e52-fd627fe7ccf4",
                                "text": "À l'école, le caractère violentogène de toute stratégie d'imposition pédagogique ne peut qu'être un impensé radical de l'institution,"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3a661e37-2d78-4aeb-9d8a-e8093fbee11a",
                                "sense_id": "5b67d4bf-eda7-3322-9e52-fd627fe7ccf4",
                                "text": "Bon nombre de musulmans entretiennent un rapport très lâche au religieux, mais l'athéisme reste un impensé et un tabou complet. L'islam ne reconnaît toujours pas le droit à l'athéisme, ni le droit de changer de religion."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
